  "description": "On the day of his high school graduation, when white snow fell like his name, Baek Seol, who had secretly loved his junior Yu O-Geon, tried to confess his feelings one last time but met a tragic end. But years later, when they reunite by chance, O-Geon approaches him actively, unlike in the past. Baek Seol finds himself shaken once more by the feelings of his first love, which he had carefully tucked away...\n\n*Like that first cigarette, stale and musty from age, I should have discarded my first love before it went bad...*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
